    "kind": "certification",
    "proves": "Verify that etcd quorum is maintained when non-etcd nodes fail.\n\nThis test stops node-5 (a worker node with no etcd member), then verifies:\n  - etcd still reports 3 healthy members\n  - The cluster stays in \"healthy\" status\n  - All services remain registered in etcd\n  - The cluster can process reads (service matrix still reachable)\n\netcd requires (N/2)+1 members for quorum. With 3 members, 2 must be\navailable. Stopping a non-etcd node should have zero impact on quorum.\n\nThis proves that the quickstart cluster correctly separates etcd membership\nfrom worker node presence \u2014 etcd quorum is determined by the founding 3 nodes\n(node-1, node-2, node-3), not by worker nodes (node-4, node-5).",
